01:36:25,714 --> 01:36:31,714
That's Entertainment!

11
01:46:04,285 --> 01:46:10,285
is a 1974 American compilation film released by
Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer to celebrate the studio's  50th anniversary.

12
01:55:42,857 --> 01:55:48,857
The success of the retrospective prompted a 1976 sequel, the related 1985
film That's Dancing!, and a third installment in 1994.

13
